{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52797","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 魏盈","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门挂冠处，西汉祖筵开。\n乃是黄庭老，言辞丹阙来。\n方称四皓德，更仰二疏才。\n今日青溪路，何时谒帝回。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏盈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}